==English==

===Alternative forms===
* [[Taleban]]

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|ps|en}} {{term|طالبان||students, seekers|lang=ps}}, a Pashto plural of Arabic {{term|طالب||seeker, student|lang=ar}}.

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun}}

# A [[Sunni]] [[Islamic]] [[student]] [[movement]] in [[Afghanistan]]; organized in 1994 by the [[radical]] [[mullah]] "Mohammad Omar"

